          "stig_uuid": "056871b0-2da4-5a77-a8da-3ccce8d1c8a5",
          "status": "open",
          "comments": "DEMO ONLY — fictional review by Demo Reviewer A. No check commands were executed.\nReference: V-214266 / SV-214266r961470_rule. Unicode sample: café, résumé, Ω.",
          "finding_details": "DEMO ONLY — simulated finding.\nA fictional configuration does not meet the requirement.\nExample evidence label: DEMO-V-214266 (no real evidence file).",
