          "comments": "DEMO ONLY — fictional review by Demo Reviewer A. No check commands were executed.\nReference: V-230221 / SV-230221r1017040_rule. Unicode sample: café, résumé, Ω.",
          "finding_details": "DEMO ONLY — simulated finding.\nA fictional configuration does not meet the requirement.\nExample evidence label: DEMO-V-230221 (no real evidence file).",
