          "comments": "DEMO ONLY — fictional review by Demo Reviewer A. No check commands were executed.\nReference: V-230227 / SV-230227r1017046_rule. Unicode sample: café, résumé, Ω.",
          "finding_details": "DEMO ONLY — fictional scope decision.\nThe example feature is not used on this imaginary asset. This is not applicability guidance.",
          "overrides": {},
          "xccdf_source": {
            "benchmark_id": "RHEL_8_STIG",
            "rule_id": "SV-230227r1017046_rule",
            "check_system": "C-32896r567427_chk",
            "references": [
              {
                "href": "",
                "fields": [
